WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.945
Mole and Rat opened the door.

2
00:00:18.946 --> 00:00:24.671
Outside, ten young field mice stood in a line.

3
00:00:24.672 --> 00:00:28.407
"What fine boys!" said Rat.

4
00:00:28.408 --> 00:00:32.747
"What colorful red mufflers!" cried Mole.

5
00:00:32.748 --> 00:00:36.338
The mice looked up with bright eyes.

6
00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:39.538
An older mouse held up a lantern.

7
00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:44.738
"Now, one, two, three!" he cried.

8
00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:50.002
Together, their tiny voices rose in the air.

9
00:00:50.003 --> 00:00:54.966
Let your doors open wide.

10
00:00:54.967 --> 00:00:59.154
Even with the snow outside,

11
00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:04.949
Bring us in by the fire.

12
00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:12.068
You will have joy in the morning!

13
00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:16.378
Here we stand in the cold and sleet,

14
00:01:16.379 --> 00:01:20.676
Frozen fingers and frozen feet.

15
00:01:20.677 --> 00:01:26.941
You by the fire, bring us in from the street.

16
00:01:26.942 --> 00:01:34.747
You will have joy in the morning!

17
00:01:34.748 --> 00:01:38.339
The mice ended their song and smiled.

18
00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:42.138
"Very well sung!" cried Rat.

19
00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:47.000
"Ah, listen!" said Mole. "The bells!"

20
00:01:47.001 --> 00:01:51.813
Church bells rang in the distance.

21
00:01:51.814 --> 00:01:54.508
"Now come on in.

22
00:01:54.509 --> 00:01:56.540
All of you!" said Rat.

23
00:01:56.541 --> 00:02:00.339
"Yes, come in!" said Mole, smiling.

24
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.222
"This is just like old times.

25
00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:07.938
I always give the mice a feast after they sing."

26
00:02:07.939 --> 00:02:12.151
The field mice all hurried inside.

27
00:02:12.152 --> 00:02:16.473
They stood by the fire, warming their paws.

28
00:02:16.474 --> 00:02:19.737
Mole was suddenly upset.

29
00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:24.683
"Rat," he said, "we have nothing to give them!"

30
00:02:24.684 --> 00:02:28.156
"I'll take care of it!" said Rat.

31
00:02:28.157 --> 00:02:32.008
Rat pointed to the older mouse with the lantern.

32
00:02:32.009 --> 00:02:34.335
He was the choir leader.

33
00:02:34.336 --> 00:02:36.773
"Come here," Rat said.

34
00:02:36.774 --> 00:02:40.109
"I want to talk to you."
